// [user 2026-08-17] East's Johnson M1941, imported as an ADDITION.
// His shader names were literally part1..part16 and his textures were textures/1.jpg..
// 16.jpg at the texture ROOT - about the most collision-prone naming possible. Renamed
// johnson_part* over textures/coop_johnson/. Model/anims/textures by East
// (moh-db.com/mods/16967); textures partly from CoD2, per his readme.

